
>> shop := (Faclair ùr
	cuir: ['magazine'] aig: ['books'],
	cuir: ['computer'] aig: ['electronics'],
	cuir: ['lipstick'] aig: ['cosmetics']
).
Às-chur sgrìobh: (shop tha-aige: ['computer']), loidhne-ùr. 
Às-chur sgrìobh: (shop tha-aige: ['sausage']), loidhne-ùr. 
Às-chur sgrìobh: (shop tha-aige: ['computers']), loidhne-ùr. 
Às-chur sgrìobh: (shop tha-aige: ['compute']), loidhne-ùr. 
Às-chur sgrìobh: (shop tha-aige: ['2computer']), loidhne-ùr. 
